WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:07.740
♪♪

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.376
-Hey, guys.
Welcome back to the show.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.211
Tonight we're visiting all five
boroughs in New York City,

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.347
and right now here in Manhattan
at the world-famous

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.949
Madame Tussauds Wax Museum
in Times Square.

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.652
Millions of people visit here
every year to see wax figures

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.221
of their favorite celebrities,

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:22.722
and I want to have
a little fun with them.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:24.490
And so does my first guest.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.659
You can see new episodes
of his docuseries,

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.295
"More Than an Athlete,"
Thursdays on ESPN+.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:32.165
Here he is, Michael Strahan.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.402
[ Laughs ]
-Hey, buddy, how you doing?

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:38.471
Hey, everybody! I'm here!

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:42.508
-Michael, you and I have a lot
in common besides our physiques.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:43.876
-Yeah, I'm wearing
your suit right now.

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:46.312
-We both have wax figures
of ourselves on display

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.681
here at Madame Tussauds,
and so I thought it would be fun

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.383
to pretend to be our wax figures
and then surprise people.

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:52.785
-Oh, that's fun.
-Ready to do this?

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.320
-Let's do it.
-Let's do it.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.790
♪♪

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.794
-Wow. Okay.
-Hey, Jimmy. How are ya?

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:05.064
-I've never seen
the back of my ear.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.000
-Now you're making me look
at the back of my ear.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.434 line:0%
I've never seen it, either.

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.770 line:0%
Oh, my God. They even got
the crooked finger.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.305 line:0%
-Wow. That's wild.
-Look at that.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.108
-Hey. You ever held your own
hand with the same hand?

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:17.476
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:21.514
-Okay, folks. This is Tim.
He's your photographer today.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.049
-Hey, guys. Nice to meet you.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.583
You guys big
"Tonight Show" fans?

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:25.652
-Yes.
-Yeah!

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:28.087
-All right. Cool.
All right. So here we go.

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:31.291
And three, two, one.

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.324
Big smiles!

00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:34.994
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.596
-That was great.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.930
-[ Shrieks ]

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.098
-[ Laughs ]
-Oh, my God!

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:40.466
-That was really good.

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:42.101
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:44.770
-My mom's gonna kill me for
meeting you without telling her!

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.205
-[ Laughs ]
-Michael.

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:48.474
-It's so nice to meet you.
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:49.975
-Hi. Jimmy.
-This is Jimmy.

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.877
-You don't think they're just
gonna immediately know it's us?

00:01:51.877 --> 00:01:54.881
-For some reason, I think
that we can get away with it.

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:56.182
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.750
-Here comes the next contestant.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:01.587
Take a seat.
Take a seat at the bench.

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:03.989
Yeah. This looks great.
-[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.392
-You can set down your bags,
yeah.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:07.960
[ Women scream ]

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.328
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:02:09.328 --> 00:02:11.064
♪♪

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.900
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.402
-I couldn't hold my face still
any longer!

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.804
I'm like, "Oh, my God.
They're onto us."

00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:21.908
-All right.
And three, two, one...

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.342
[ Slide whistle blows ]

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:24.810
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.412
♪♪

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:29.716
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.217
-Did you know it?
-I knew it!

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.854
-Let's have you sit down
on the bench right here.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.389
Beautiful. Cool.

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:40.560
All right.
And three, two, one...

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.694
-Catch!
-Catch!

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.730
-Oh, my gosh!
-[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.564
-Ohh!

00:02:45.564 --> 00:02:48.201 line:0%
-Oh, my God. I was like...

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:49.535 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:50.936
-How are you?
-He said it looked so real.

00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:52.771
We are real. We're here, man.
-We actually are real.

00:02:52.771 --> 00:02:55.674
-Here we go.
Three, two, one...

00:02:55.674 --> 00:02:57.276
-Yeah!
-Hey!

00:02:57.276 --> 00:02:59.445
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:00.646
-This is great.

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:02.782
Let's get a real picture.
Come on.

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:04.950
Come on. One, two, three...

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.752
-Hey!
-Hey!

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:08.888
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

